faba-icon-theme (4.3-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Packaging changes:
    - d/control - switch from obsolete gnome-icon-theme to
      elementary-xfce-icon-theme (Closes: #1117092)
      Make the package a recommendation instead of a dependency
